WEBVTT

00:15.515 --> 00:17.100
Hey, who are you?

00:18.602 --> 00:21.854
You fucking bastard!
Actually, actually, you know what?

00:21.855 --> 00:23.356
Forget it.

00:23.357 --> 00:25.526
I don't really care who you are.
It doesn't matter.

00:26.193 --> 00:27.694
And I won't try to find out, either.

00:29.071 --> 00:32.823
Just give me back the van.
Turn around and come back.

00:32.824 --> 00:34.575
I'm gonna find you tonight anyway.

00:36.578 --> 00:37.829
Then you're done.

01:21.832 --> 01:26.545
HAPPY! GANGWON

02:10.422 --> 02:15.636
EPISODE 1
BETTING

02:45.457 --> 02:47.959
Hi there.
Is the captain at home?

02:48.710 --> 02:51.671
Oh, he's away for work right now.

02:51.672 --> 02:54.049
Oh, is that right?

02:55.300 --> 02:59.845
It's just, well, the rent.
It's really overdue.

02:59.846 --> 03:02.598
It's been over three months now, right?

03:02.599 --> 03:05.142
You know, we're not just talking about one
or two months.

03:05.143 --> 03:06.727
We're talking about three months.

03:06.728 --> 03:10.523
Look, if he's going through something,
I understand, but...

03:12.901 --> 03:14.985
He could at least tell me
what's going on.

03:17.030 --> 03:19.740
Instead, he ignores all
my calls and my texts.

03:19.741 --> 03:22.160
You two aren't having any problems
or anything, are you?

03:22.828 --> 03:24.829
I know I shouldn't say this to you.

03:24.830 --> 03:26.164
Tell him for me?

03:30.127 --> 03:31.919
CONNECTING CALL...
DOKYUNG

03:35.424 --> 03:38.175
Your call has been forwarded
to an automated voice messaging...

03:40.971 --> 03:45.558
YOU'RE COMING TODAY, RIGHT?

03:45.559 --> 03:49.186
You're going
to absolutely love this trip.

03:49.187 --> 03:53.482
THE LANDLADY CAME BY ABOUT THE RENT.

03:53.483 --> 03:57.987
Home to the Mona Lisa.
This is the best that Europe has to offer.

03:57.988 --> 04:04.452
TRAVEL SAFE. SEE YOU LATER

04:04.453 --> 04:08.164
Enjoy an easy, rewarding,
and comfortable experience.

04:08.165 --> 04:09.415
And for those of you...

04:09.416 --> 04:12.209
ARRIVING AT 3:00 O'CLOCK

04:14.463 --> 04:16.755
I'm sorry but this card was declined.

04:16.756 --> 04:18.048
Are you sure?

04:18.049 --> 04:19.634
Could you just try it one more time,
please?
:cue

04:25.140 --> 04:26.141
It's not going through.

04:26.975 --> 04:30.394
Uh, how much is the total?

04:30.395 --> 04:32.438
Welcome.

04:32.439 --> 04:35.775
Please press the number of the transaction
you would like to complete.

04:35.776 --> 04:37.401
Please enter the amount you...

04:37.402 --> 04:38.611
INSUFFICIENT ACCOUNT BALANCE.
KRW 0.

04:38.612 --> 04:39.987
PLEASE CHECK YOUR AVAILABLE BALANCE
BEFORE PROCEEDING WITH THE TRANSACTION.

04:39.988 --> 04:41.448
Please take your card.

05:04.429 --> 05:08.141
YOU'RE COMING TODAY, RIGHT?
TRAVEL SAFE. SEE YOU LATER

05:15.482 --> 05:17.901
See you soon.
I love you.

05:21.655 --> 05:23.156
Love you.

05:34.251 --> 05:36.252
INTERNATIONAL ARRIVALS

05:44.052 --> 05:46.178
A404 THAILAND/SUVARNABHUMI
15:00 ARRIVED

05:46.179 --> 05:48.055
Attention, passengers.

05:48.056 --> 05:51.517
Final boarding call
for flight 407 to Tokyo.

06:04.447 --> 06:07.658
Hi. I have a question.
Do you know this woman?

06:07.659 --> 06:09.076
She works here.

06:18.378 --> 06:21.005
Yes,
we were able to make note

06:21.006 --> 06:22.548
of this shipment but we still have...

06:23.675 --> 06:24.925
X-RAY WARNING: WHEN THE EQUIPMENT
IS IN OPERATION,

06:24.926 --> 06:26.302
DO NOT PLACE ANY PART OF YOUR BODY
INSIDE UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES

06:26.303 --> 06:27.636
NO UNAUTHORIZED ENTRY

06:27.637 --> 06:29.306
Belt two, unload the cargo.

06:31.182 --> 06:32.516
Which one is it?

06:37.355 --> 06:39.607
That's right!

06:39.608 --> 06:41.108
Aren't you off this weekend?

06:41.109 --> 06:44.111
We're all going to Sokcho to check out
this hot new night club.

06:44.112 --> 06:45.738
You should come with us!

06:45.739 --> 06:47.239
I've got things to do at home.

06:47.240 --> 06:48.867
Oh, come on. No, you don't.

06:49.534 --> 06:51.827
You can't just be cooped up here all
the time.

06:51.828 --> 06:53.662
You gotta go out and have fun, too.

06:53.663 --> 06:55.623
Sorry, guys.
I'll join you on the next one.

06:55.624 --> 06:57.625
She plays hard to get, doesn't she?

06:59.461 --> 07:00.712
You're not here to fool around.

07:04.674 --> 07:05.966
Not without me, you aren't.

07:06.801 --> 07:08.636
Of course you have to come with us!

07:08.637 --> 07:09.553
Where would we go without you?

07:09.554 --> 07:10.679
So where are we going?

07:10.680 --> 07:12.973
We're gonna go clubbing, duh!

07:12.974 --> 07:14.141
Wait, Heeju.

07:14.142 --> 07:16.936
- Can we talk for a minute?
- Oh, okay.

07:23.610 --> 07:24.819
Earlier today...

07:25.570 --> 07:27.447
This guy came by and said he
was your uncle.

07:28.531 --> 07:32.576
He showed me an old school photo
of you and asked if I knew you.

07:32.577 --> 07:35.664
He said that an acquaintance of his saw
you working here in your security uniform.

07:36.706 --> 07:38.999
So what did you tell him?

07:39.000 --> 07:40.251
That no one here looks like that.

07:41.628 --> 07:44.339
If he doesn't know,
there's gotta be a reason, right?

07:45.090 --> 07:46.299
Is he really your uncle?

07:47.634 --> 07:48.718
No, he's not.

07:50.303 --> 07:51.304
I thought so.

07:52.597 --> 07:55.016
He just seems kinda odd.

07:57.394 --> 07:58.769
Who was he?

07:58.770 --> 08:01.021
Did you get mixed up with a loan shark?

08:01.022 --> 08:04.316
Uh, no.
It's nothing like that.

08:04.317 --> 08:05.318
Then who was it?

08:06.069 --> 08:07.820
Tell me and maybe I can help you.

08:07.821 --> 08:10.323
You hardly ever talk about yourself.

08:11.116 --> 08:13.118
I'm sorry.
Can I ask...

08:14.327 --> 08:18.623
If that man ever comes back,
could you tell him I don't work here?

08:19.541 --> 08:20.625
I can do that.

08:22.669 --> 08:25.255
Just be careful outside of work, too.

08:25.797 --> 08:27.756
Word of advice.

08:27.757 --> 08:30.843
If you didn't do anything wrong,
don't run away.

08:30.844 --> 08:35.140
Once you start running from guys like him,
you'll end up running your whole life.

08:38.184 --> 08:39.185
Yes.

08:40.019 --> 08:41.521
I appreciate it, ma'am.
:cue

09:40.747 --> 09:42.582
What do you guys want?

09:43.708 --> 09:46.002
You just had to come all this way here
to find me? Really?

09:47.837 --> 09:48.838
You're a difficult man to reach.

09:56.805 --> 09:58.348
Look, I always repay Geumseong back,
don't I?

09:59.182 --> 10:00.266
I heard it's been a year.

10:04.771 --> 10:06.356
Let's talk it over in Jeongsan.

10:07.941 --> 10:10.068
Well, let's say you go back
to Jeongsan now.

10:10.819 --> 10:13.947
The boys here will have
to clean you out.

10:14.906 --> 10:17.200
Your organs.
They're healthy, right?

10:18.201 --> 10:19.284
What?

10:19.285 --> 10:20.912
It's a joke, man. A joke.

10:21.579 --> 10:22.956
We wouldn't do that to you.

10:23.540 --> 10:24.541
We'll be partners.

10:25.125 --> 10:26.709
Forever and ever.

10:31.923 --> 10:33.091
What do you want me to do now?

10:34.342 --> 10:35.343
Hold your questions.

10:36.511 --> 10:39.139
First up, we need
to check your collateral.

10:46.813 --> 10:48.188
Where have you been?

10:48.189 --> 10:49.440
I'm still in Bangkok.

10:50.150 --> 10:51.151
What?

10:52.193 --> 10:54.027
-  What are you still doing there?
- I'll tell you later.

10:54.028 --> 10:55.363
Where are you now?
Are you home?

10:56.197 --> 10:57.823
Yeah. I just walked in.

10:57.824 --> 10:59.158
Get out of the house right now, Heeju.

10:59.159 --> 11:01.451
What? Why?

11:01.452 --> 11:03.370
There's no time.
Just get out right now.

11:03.371 --> 11:07.207
Grab whatever you need, clothes, photos,
and get out of there.

11:07.208 --> 11:09.127
Some people are headed
over there right now.

11:10.128 --> 11:11.712
They can't know that you're there.

11:11.713 --> 11:13.422
Some people? Who?

11:13.423 --> 11:15.799
There's no time to explain!
Just go!

11:15.800 --> 11:17.926
-  Call me after you've left.
- What are you talking about?

11:17.927 --> 11:19.470
H-hello?

11:29.522 --> 11:31.149
Pictures.

11:32.400 --> 11:33.943
Oh, my passport.

11:34.652 --> 11:35.778
Got it.

11:49.209 --> 11:51.878
What the fuck?
Someone lives here.

11:52.378 --> 11:53.629
Ah, dammit.

11:53.630 --> 11:56.507
Hello? Is anyone here?

11:57.133 --> 11:59.551
Look around.
What is this?

12:01.137 --> 12:03.431
- Go check the balcony.
- Ah, shit.
:cue

12:08.519 --> 12:09.771
Nothing here.

12:10.480 --> 12:11.606
You checked everything?

12:12.190 --> 12:16.193
Ah, shit.
Where the hell are they, dammit?

12:16.194 --> 12:17.694
Did you go in there?

12:41.469 --> 12:43.304
- Heeju, where are you right now?
-  I'm on the bus.

12:45.348 --> 12:47.015
You need to tell me
what's going on.

12:47.016 --> 12:48.350
What do those people want with you?

12:48.351 --> 12:50.185
Don't worry about them.
It's nothing.

12:50.186 --> 12:52.604
You don't think it's a big deal that
a group of strange men

12:52.605 --> 12:53.856
just barged in through the door?

12:57.068 --> 12:59.528
Talk to me.
What's going on?

12:59.529 --> 13:01.196
I already told you it's okay.

13:01.197 --> 13:02.864
You don't need to worry about it.

13:02.865 --> 13:04.616
Your credit card has been frozen,

13:04.617 --> 13:06.828
and I learned your rent
is overdue by three months.

13:07.662 --> 13:09.872
The landlady came by asking for you.

13:10.748 --> 13:13.501
Dokyung, are you still gambling?

13:14.836 --> 13:16.628
Did you use a loan shark?

13:16.629 --> 13:20.550
Yeah, I went to a casino
with my friends last year.

13:21.676 --> 13:23.135
How much?

13:23.136 --> 13:24.762
I have a little bit
of money saved.

13:26.597 --> 13:29.266
It wasn't much.
And I paid it off.

13:29.267 --> 13:31.268
Then why did those people come?

13:31.269 --> 13:33.104
I just paid them back now.

13:34.522 --> 13:37.066
Well then, can I just go back?

13:38.067 --> 13:39.944
No, stay at a hotel.
I'll be there tomorrow.

13:40.778 --> 13:43.030
I know I was supposed to be back today.

13:43.031 --> 13:46.158
But there were some complications
that came up.

13:46.159 --> 13:48.785
Basically, this chairman I know
who lives in Cambodia.

13:48.786 --> 13:49.953
He's Korean.

13:49.954 --> 13:52.831
And one of his employees
actually passed away in

13:52.832 --> 13:54.083
an accident over here.

13:54.709 --> 13:57.211
We need to ship his body back
to Korea by tomorrow.

13:58.713 --> 14:01.298
But you know how that stuff
can be complicated.

14:01.299 --> 14:03.341
So he called me to ask
if I could help out.

14:03.342 --> 14:06.262
I see.
Are you sure everything's okay?

14:07.263 --> 14:08.806
Nothing will happen to us, right?

14:09.891 --> 14:12.518
Everything will be fine.
Just trust me.

14:13.436 --> 14:15.020
But Heeju?

14:15.021 --> 14:16.981
I do have one small favor to ask.

14:19.442 --> 14:21.778
The, uh, casket,
the one I'm shipping tomorrow...

14:22.612 --> 14:25.739
Would you be able to handle
the airport security check?

14:25.740 --> 14:27.074
I'm off tomorrow.

14:27.075 --> 14:28.950
But you can swap shifts
with someone.

14:28.951 --> 14:32.079
I need you to make sure the casket
gets past the checkpoint, okay?

14:32.080 --> 14:36.374
And if the scanners should see something,
just let it through.

14:36.375 --> 14:37.876
Why? What's in it?

14:37.877 --> 14:39.628
I'm just saying,
in case something goes wrong.

14:39.629 --> 14:42.340
Okay. What could go wrong?

14:44.175 --> 14:45.176
Nothing.

14:47.053 --> 14:48.054
Trust me, Heeju.

14:50.056 --> 14:51.765
Do what I tell you to do.

14:51.766 --> 14:53.850
Shoot, the chairman is here.

14:53.851 --> 14:56.187
I need to go.
Please don't forget.

14:56.729 --> 14:58.105
Flight A404.

14:58.106 --> 15:01.734
It's departing from Siem Riep
at 7:00 A.M. tomorrow, 'kay?

15:03.319 --> 15:04.528
Love you.

15:05.947 --> 15:07.698
Yeah, love you-

15:20.419 --> 15:23.422
:cue

15:51.534 --> 15:53.451
- Hi, you guys.
-  Hi, Heeju!

15:53.452 --> 15:55.163
- Hi.
- Come on. Just ask her.

15:56.038 --> 15:57.372
Weren't you off today?

15:57.373 --> 16:00.417
Uh, Yerim and I changed shifts.

16:00.418 --> 16:01.710
Really? Why? Is she okay?

16:01.711 --> 16:02.712
I don't know.

16:03.129 --> 16:05.672
Weird. It's not like her to miss a shift.

16:05.673 --> 16:07.465
Right?
Have you heard anything?

16:25.151 --> 16:26.610
RADIATION CONTROLLED AREA

16:26.611 --> 16:27.904
NO UNAUTHORIZED ENTRY

17:19.330 --> 17:20.915
What's going on with belt two?

17:21.749 --> 17:24.794
It's all the metal decorations attached
to the casket.

17:32.009 --> 17:33.594
Heeju.

17:34.762 --> 17:35.888
Let it go through.

17:37.014 --> 17:38.015
Okay.

17:58.369 --> 17:59.412
One, two, three.

18:34.697 --> 18:35.990
Long time no see, Captain.

18:37.700 --> 18:40.410
You haven't been to Gold Land much
these days, have you?

18:40.411 --> 18:41.828
You've been up to somethin' big.

18:43.164 --> 18:46.584
If you need any dough,
just let me know and I can help you out.

18:47.918 --> 18:48.919
What am I saying?

18:50.296 --> 18:51.964
You don't need petty cash
from grunts like us.

18:52.632 --> 18:54.090
Sorry.

19:06.520 --> 19:07.604
The hell is this?

19:07.605 --> 19:09.689
What's it look like?
It's a gun.

19:09.690 --> 19:11.149
A real gun.

19:11.150 --> 19:12.734
It's fully loaded.
Wanna check?

19:12.735 --> 19:13.944
What?

19:14.779 --> 19:16.321
Look. Look, that exit on the right.

19:16.322 --> 19:17.656
I need you to get off there.

19:17.657 --> 19:19.324
Captain, why are you...

19:19.325 --> 19:22.077
Hey, fucking hell! Hold the wheel!
Hands on the fucking wheel!

19:22.078 --> 19:24.496
Listen, we're gonna take
the next exit.

19:24.497 --> 19:26.790
- Just take the fucking exit.
- We can't-we can't do this.

19:26.791 --> 19:28.249
I said take the fucking exit, man!

19:31.587 --> 19:34.339
What the fuck?
Where are they going?

19:34.340 --> 19:35.341
Who the fuck is driving?

19:36.342 --> 19:37.425
Woogy, sir.

19:37.426 --> 19:38.885
Shit.
:cue

19:42.890 --> 19:44.350
BOSS

19:45.184 --> 19:48.062
Hey. Eyes on the road.
Keep going.

19:51.273 --> 19:54.610
I said just focus on driving,
you fucking dumb ass!

19:55.486 --> 19:56.487
Oh, fuck.

20:09.458 --> 20:11.085
Get the fuck out, you asshole.

20:13.379 --> 20:14.796
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, wait, wait.
- What?

20:14.797 --> 20:16.756
Can I at least have my phone? Please?

20:16.757 --> 20:19.343
Yeah. Call them.

20:24.306 --> 20:25.557
Shit.

20:25.558 --> 20:28.144
Fuckin' asshole!
Fuck you, man!

20:34.024 --> 20:35.025
What's going on?

20:36.110 --> 20:37.403
You even called in the boys.

20:38.320 --> 20:39.321
We gotta take care of some meat.

20:40.865 --> 20:41.866
A debtor?

20:44.952 --> 20:46.369
Just cutting off parts or butchering?

20:46.370 --> 20:47.829
Butcher as usual.

20:49.165 --> 20:51.499
Strip him clean
and hand it all over.

20:51.500 --> 20:53.460
We aren't really prepared for that.

20:53.461 --> 20:54.712
You could have warned us.

20:55.212 --> 20:57.130
- Hey, Seokgu!
-  Yes, boss.

20:57.131 --> 20:58.673
Call Mr. Jin and tell him to come over.

20:58.674 --> 21:00.675
- Tell him don't forget his tools.
- Right away, boss. Yes.

21:03.846 --> 21:04.847
Who's that?

21:07.266 --> 21:08.809
INCOMING CALL
CAPTAIN LEE DOKYUNG

21:12.313 --> 21:14.190
Hey, Captain.
Have you arrived yet?

21:15.149 --> 21:16.150
Where you at?

21:16.734 --> 21:18.694
Oh, I guess they haven't
let you know.

21:19.403 --> 21:21.280
I'm the one driving
the funeral van now.

21:22.531 --> 21:24.574
And I managed to shake off all your men.

21:24.575 --> 21:27.161
The casket is safe,
so don't worry about that.

21:27.953 --> 21:28.954
Captain.

21:29.914 --> 21:32.165
What exactly are you saying?

21:32.166 --> 21:35.251
I owe Yes Money two hundred million won, right?

21:35.252 --> 21:37.588
You agree to write it off
if I help move the casket.

21:38.380 --> 21:40.048
212 million.

21:40.049 --> 21:41.592
Well, close enough.

21:42.551 --> 21:45.596
I'm sorry to say,
I don't think that's gonna cut it.

21:47.181 --> 21:49.725
Also, you really don't want me
hanging around in Korea, right?

21:50.351 --> 21:52.102
I want a billion won in cash.

21:53.270 --> 21:56.106
Then I'll return the casket
and quietly disappear.

21:58.567 --> 22:00.194
I noticed it was pretty heavy.

22:01.612 --> 22:04.656
That's a lot of drugs.
Must be worth at least 10 billion.

22:04.657 --> 22:07.284
I'm risking my life
to transport this thing.

22:08.035 --> 22:09.452
I want ten percent.

22:09.453 --> 22:12.414
Not a bad deal for shipping cost, right?

22:14.041 --> 22:15.668
You made yourself very clear.

22:18.212 --> 22:19.963
This is gonna take some time, though.

22:19.964 --> 22:22.132
I gotta get approval
from the chairman first.

22:22.883 --> 22:23.967
Then we have to prepare the cash.

22:23.968 --> 22:25.928
You can have up until midnight.

22:27.429 --> 22:29.180
I'll be waiting at Geumsong.

22:29.181 --> 22:30.891
First I'll check the cash.

22:31.433 --> 22:33.394
And then I'll give you
the location of the van.

22:34.895 --> 22:37.189
Okay. Let's do that.

22:56.166 --> 22:57.918
Fuckin' bastard!

23:15.311 --> 23:18.105
Kim Jinman,
Jeongsan Police Investigations.

23:18.772 --> 23:20.440
It's Park Hocheol.

23:20.441 --> 23:22.525
I need you to track a phone for me.

23:22.526 --> 23:25.194
Whose phone?
What for?

23:25.195 --> 23:27.280
That's none of your business.
You got until midnight.

23:27.281 --> 23:29.115
Oh, come on.

23:29.116 --> 23:31.368
You know that's not the kind
of thing I can do so easily.

23:32.286 --> 23:34.954
I mean, I have to get
a warrant and everything.

23:34.955 --> 23:36.957
It'd be illegal without one.

23:37.708 --> 23:39.335
It involves the Chairman.

23:40.210 --> 23:42.671
Name and phone number.

23:43.213 --> 23:44.214
Lee Dokyung.

23:45.049 --> 23:46.508
Lee Dokyung.
:cue

23:57.144 --> 23:58.103
MOBILE PHONE
DOKYUNG

23:59.021 --> 24:00.022
Hello?

25:10.801 --> 25:13.720
Heeju. Heeju.

25:13.721 --> 25:15.264
- Dokyung.
-  Heeju.

25:18.142 --> 25:20.018
Get in.

25:21.395 --> 25:22.687
Oh, Heeju!

25:22.688 --> 25:23.938
It's okay. It's okay.

25:23.939 --> 25:25.648
You must have been scared.

25:25.649 --> 25:26.899
Mm-hmm.

25:26.900 --> 25:27.901
It's all right.

25:30.612 --> 25:32.156
- You left your phone, right?
- Mm-hmm.

25:34.283 --> 25:36.784
From now on
we only use these, okay?

25:36.785 --> 25:39.912
I need you to listen
to me very carefully, Heeju.

25:39.913 --> 25:41.622
I'm gonna go meet up
with someone right now.

25:41.623 --> 25:42.875
They're gonna give me
some money.

25:43.542 --> 25:44.625
It's a lot.

25:44.626 --> 25:46.377
Enough for us to leave
this place for good.

25:46.378 --> 25:47.754
A billion won.

25:47.755 --> 25:50.506
- Huh?
-  I'll be right back, okay?

25:50.507 --> 25:51.924
You stay here and wait in the van.

25:51.925 --> 25:53.259
Then when I call you
on this phone,

25:53.260 --> 25:54.886
all you have to do is bring the van
to the place I tell you.

25:54.887 --> 25:56.763
Wait, what-what are you talking...

25:56.764 --> 25:58.639
It's not far.
Just listen to me!

25:58.640 --> 25:59.641
If I don't...

26:00.726 --> 26:03.144
If you haven't received a call
from me by midnight,

26:03.145 --> 26:05.063
then take this van and run away.

26:05.064 --> 26:06.648
And ditch the phone.

26:07.775 --> 26:10.860
As long as you have that casket,
they won't be able to hurt me.

26:10.861 --> 26:12.612
Who are you meeting with?

26:12.613 --> 26:15.114
And what the hell is in that thing?

26:15.115 --> 26:17.575
- Seriously, just tell me what's going on!
- It'll all be over soon.

26:17.576 --> 26:19.410
- You don't need to know about this, Heeju.
-  Why?

26:19.411 --> 26:20.788
What aren't you telling me?

26:24.541 --> 26:25.958
Dokyung.

26:25.959 --> 26:29.587
Listen, I will do exactly
as you say.

26:29.588 --> 26:31.881
That's exactly why I need to know.

26:31.882 --> 26:33.550
What am I doing and why?

26:37.387 --> 26:38.847
I'll explain everything later.

26:39.640 --> 26:41.140
When it's over,

26:41.141 --> 26:43.142
the two of us should go to France.

26:43.143 --> 26:44.727
A fresh start.
We'll forget all this.

26:44.728 --> 26:48.064
We can finally be happy. Okay?

26:48.065 --> 26:49.358
I'm begging you.

26:50.359 --> 26:51.360
Please.

27:00.994 --> 27:02.621
Thank you.

27:03.789 --> 27:06.500
I'll be back.
Just be careful.

27:22.641 --> 27:25.644
:cue

28:07.728 --> 28:09.479
Shit.

28:10.856 --> 28:12.648
He must be dead, right?

28:12.649 --> 28:14.860
I hit him pretty damn hard.

28:20.282 --> 28:23.534
Hey! Go over
and search every inch of the place!

28:23.535 --> 28:25.037
It's there somewhere.

28:25.704 --> 28:28.415
-  Get going! Run!
- Ah, fuck.

28:35.255 --> 28:36.506
Hurry up.

29:23.595 --> 29:26.848
-  Run away, Heeju.
- Dokyung.

29:27.683 --> 29:28.808
I'm sorry.

29:28.809 --> 29:31.520
What? No, no, no.
Dokyung, are you there?

29:32.354 --> 29:33.771
Please don't go!

29:33.772 --> 29:35.815
Dokyung, are you there?
Please don't go!

29:35.816 --> 29:37.234
Don't...

31:21.004 --> 31:22.339
Sir, I found the van.

31:23.173 --> 31:26.176
Yeah, it's in the warehouse
at the top on the right.

31:29.596 --> 31:30.972
Okay, you stay put.

31:32.057 --> 31:33.307
Hey, boss!

31:33.308 --> 31:34.725
They found the van!

31:34.726 --> 31:37.437
We need the keys!
Check and see if the keys are with him.
:cue

31:43.151 --> 31:44.277
No keys here!

31:45.612 --> 31:47.613
Someone's in the van!

31:47.614 --> 31:48.906
Oh, fuck!

31:48.907 --> 31:51.535
Hey, block the van!
Hurry! Move it! Move it!

33:42.020 --> 33:45.773
-  Fuck.
-  Boss! What the...

34:15.887 --> 34:17.180
Fuck!

35:20.076 --> 35:21.493
Shit.

35:23.204 --> 35:25.874
:cue

36:01.284 --> 36:02.951
Hey, who are you?

36:02.952 --> 36:04.870
You fucking bastard.

36:04.871 --> 36:07.790
Ah, actually, actually, you know what?
Forget it.

36:07.791 --> 36:09.959
I don't really care who you are.
It doesn't matter.

36:11.711 --> 36:13.463
And I won't try to find out, either.

36:14.005 --> 36:17.549
Just give me back the van.
Turn around and come back.

36:17.550 --> 36:19.719
You can have
the money I promised Dokyung.

36:20.970 --> 36:22.430
I can send it right away.

36:24.849 --> 36:27.559
If you haven't received
a call from me by midnight,

36:27.560 --> 36:29.520
then I need you to take this van
and run away.

36:29.521 --> 36:31.313
And ditch this phone.

36:31.314 --> 36:33.108
As long as you have that casket,
they won't be able to hurt me.

36:38.029 --> 36:39.738
You can't hide from me,
you stupid fuck,

36:39.739 --> 36:40.824
so just hand it over!

36:42.575 --> 36:44.202
I'm gonna find you tonight anyway.

36:49.082 --> 36:50.166
Then you're done.

37:08.560 --> 37:10.018
Your call
has been forwarded

37:10.019 --> 37:12.271
to an automated voice messaging system.

37:12.272 --> 37:14.190
The number you
have dialed is not available.

37:14.691 --> 37:15.692
Son of a bitch.

38:41.986 --> 38:43.655
:cue

39:31.661 --> 39:33.787
Why did it have to be here?

39:33.788 --> 39:36.331
DAD! BE SAFE AGAIN TODAY

39:36.332 --> 39:38.418
I thought I'd never see
this place again.

39:44.048 --> 39:48.344
At first, I didn't expect my path
would be like this.

39:49.596 --> 39:53.224
I only wanted to escape from my miserable
and unhappy life.

39:54.100 --> 39:55.351
Get away from it all.

40:00.315 --> 40:05.194
I was just following this
small ray of light I saw before me.

40:05.987 --> 40:07.697
Hoping that if only I could reach it...

40:09.032 --> 40:11.326
...I could escape from all this darkness.

40:12.952 --> 40:14.745
Mongsil, wait!

40:18.333 --> 40:19.626
Mongsil?

40:22.128 --> 40:23.671
Mongsil!

40:32.388 --> 40:34.015
Mongsil, here!

40:38.853 --> 40:39.854
Mongsil!

40:41.105 --> 40:42.231
Heeju.

40:43.816 --> 40:45.276
Mongsil.

40:48.529 --> 40:49.864
Mongsil.

40:53.826 --> 40:55.077
Where are you?

40:57.830 --> 40:59.957
PROCEED SLOWLY

40:59.958 --> 41:01.501
Mongsil?

41:06.255 --> 41:07.548
Are you there?

42:15.366 --> 42:17.160
Mongsil.

42:18.995 --> 42:20.496
Mommy.

42:23.666 --> 42:24.667
Heeju.

42:28.838 --> 42:29.839
Heeju.

42:31.591 --> 42:33.050
Hurry up now.

42:33.051 --> 42:35.094
You have to run away from here.

42:51.194 --> 42:53.862
I'm still not sure
what I saw back then.

42:53.863 --> 42:56.156
Was it all a dream?

42:56.157 --> 43:00.078
Or was it a memory I made up
for myself when I grew up?

43:10.046 --> 43:12.464
:cue

43:12.465 --> 43:15.008
RESTRICTED AREA

43:28.272 --> 43:29.773
PROCEED SLOWLY

43:29.774 --> 43:31.776
COMPLY AND DRIVE SLOWLY

43:41.869 --> 43:44.914
INCLINED SHAFT 8, SECTION 2
102ML

44:35.965 --> 44:38.217
How did it all end up like this?

44:39.343 --> 44:42.680
Happy. That's all I ever wanted.

44:43.556 --> 44:45.641
To be happy like everyone else.

45:35.983 --> 45:38.819
As long as you have that casket,
they won't be able to hurt me.

45:39.695 --> 45:42.240
I need you to take this van
and run away.

47:15.875 --> 47:19.170
If I hadn't come here that day...

47:22.048 --> 47:26.843
If I hadn't seen those gold bars
inside that casket,

47:26.844 --> 47:28.262
would I have been happy?

47:30.473 --> 47:34.726
Or would my life be the same,
dark as always,

47:34.727 --> 47:36.603
just like that mine shaft?
